orms conditions in the outer query not involving `GROUP BY` columns of a derived table with aggregation into the `HAVING` clause of the subquery.\n\nNote that some rules may apply to multiple parts of the given SQL query, and the rewritten queries may involve multiple transformations.", 'time': 12.178199052810669}
